SIMPLEX: 0.6

FUNCTION: greet(name) → greeting

RULES:
  - [R1] return a friendly greeting that includes the non-empty name

DONE_WHEN:
  - [D1] greeting contains the name
  - [D2] greeting is friendly

EXAMPLES:
  - [E1] value: ("Alice") → "Hello, Alice!"
  - [E2] value: ("Bob") → "Hello, Bob!"
  - [E3] error: ("") → "Name cannot be empty"

ERRORS:
  - [X1] empty name → "Name cannot be empty"
  - any unhandled condition → fail with descriptive message

COVERS:
  - E1 → R1, D1, D2
  - E2 → R1, D1, D2
  - E3 → X1
